      "note": "A token is a word, and keys, by the letters, combining marks and digits of any script left once its edges lose everything else, then lower case (word-key.ts, the class chatKey uses). \"Хлеб!\" and \"«вода»\" are cached as хлеб and вода; \"хлеб,\" and \"ВОДА\" hit them as passive encounters; \"молоко.\" asks the host once as молоко. A second sighting of \"хлеб!\" is the same word as \"Хлеб\", so it shows no hint; \"вода\" is another word, a first sighting (new-word index 2) that hints at A1. \"Соль\" set mastered keys as соль, so \"соль!\" is a first sighting (index 3) that shows no hint, and the encounters hold соль. \"и\" is one letter, so not likely.",
